# Nothing is copied into the image: the Dockerfile has no COPY, because the
# code arrives through the /work bind mount. The build context is therefore
# excluded in full, so that neither the .git directory nor a stray data file
# is ever sent to the daemon.
#
# The exclusion is not cosmetic. A build context is uploaded before the first
# instruction runs, so a file that must never leave the machine would leave it
# here, before any rule in the Dockerfile could apply.
*
